<title>USA: Today's Man Inc Q4 Feb 1 loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Today's Man Inc Q4 Feb 1 loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>MOORESTOWN, N.J. 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.01     loss	 $2.83</p>
<p> Net loss			65     loss	30,691</p>
<p> Revs			67,730		   82,747</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  10,861		   10,861</p>
<p>		 YEAR</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.54     loss	 $3.29</p>
<p> Net loss		   5,811     loss	35,684</p>
<p> Revs		     204,042		  263,256</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  10,861		   10,847</p>
<p>	 (All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Periods ended Feb. 1 vs Feb. 3.</p>
<p>Year is 52 weeks vs 53 weeks.</p>
<p>1996 periods include restructuring charges of $19.2 million.</p>
<p>1997 Q4 includes reorganization costs of $5.7 million.</p>
<p>1997 year includes reorganization costs of $8.8 million.</p>
<p>Q4 income from operations: profit $6.1 million vs loss $32.5 million.</p>
<p>Year income from operations: profit $3.5 million vs loss $37.7 million.</p>
<p>1996 periods include income tax benefits of $3.5 million in Q4 and $6.2 million in year.</p>
<p>Retailer is in Chapter 11.</p>
